<title>USA: Teamsters ratify agreement with Giant.</title>
<headline>Teamsters ratify agreement with Giant.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Members of the Teamsters Union Sunday ratified an agreement with Giant Foods Inc to settle their strike against the grocery chain, a union official said.</p>
<p>The proposed contract was approved by a vote of 247-25, the official said. The strike began December 14 and idled some 328 drivers and nearly 2,000 warehouse workers.</p>
<p>All of the workers should be back on the job by the end of the week, the official said.</p>
